    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "About The South Wing",
            "paragraphs": [
                "The South Wing is a private home in Croydon, renovated and designed by Laura Sawyer, founder of The Detail.",
                "The tour will share the story of the house: what it was like when Laura first found it, the renovation process, the design decisions behind the interiors, and how the space has evolved into both a home and a creative location.",
                "Visitors will hear about the inspiration behind the design, the balance between restoration and reinvention, and the role of colour, atmosphere, objects and detail in shaping the feeling of a space."
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Tour and Q&A",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Visitors will be invited on a guided tour of the house, followed by an informal Q&A with Laura Sawyer, founder of The Detail and designer of The South Wing.",
                "The session will cover the renovation journey, design philosophy, creative decision-making, future plans for the house, and how The South Wing now operates as a location house and cultural space."
            ]
        }
    ],
